{
  "slug": "looper-loop",
  "name": "Looper Loop",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agentic loop for a long-running task, where on each step agent's work is reviewed by another agent, to make sure it stays on track and does not finish early.\nYou will be notified in Telegram or Slack upon completion",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (1): `looperloop` (Start a detached looperloop run)\n- **Hooks** (1): `UserPromptSubmit`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `looperloop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install looper-loop@claude-community` from `Altair200333/looperloop`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
